@baseUrl = http://localhost:5006
@accessToken = replace-with-superadmin-access-token
@schoolId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### List all school tenants and assigned administrator details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/superadmin/schools
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Toggle system access for a school (this flips the current state)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/superadmin/schools/{{schoolId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Assign an existing account as the school's administrator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/superadmin/schools/{{schoolId}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "school-admin@example.edu"
}

### Unassign the school's current administrator
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/superadmin/schools/{{schoolId}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
